WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.269
FOR A 5TH DAY TODAY, CHINA
CONDUCTED MILITARY DRILLS IN

00:00:03.269 --> 00:00:05.338
WATERS AND AIRSPACE AROUND
TAIWAN.

00:00:05.338 --> 00:00:09.776
THE EXERCISES BEGAN LAST WEEK
AFTER U.S. HOUSE SPEAKER NANCY

00:00:09.776 --> 00:00:12.512
PELOSI VISITED THE SELF
GOVERNING ISLAND.

00:00:12.512 --> 00:00:16.149
TAIWAN SAYS CHINA IS
DELIBERATELY CREATING A CRISIS.

00:00:16.149 --> 00:00:20.086
CNN'S WILL RIPLEY SPOKE TO
TAIWAN'S FOREIGN MINISTER ABOUT

00:00:20.086 --> 00:00:25.091
THE GROWING TENSION.
&gt;&gt; CHINESE OFFICIALS ONLY

00:00:25.091 --> 00:00:27.727
RECEIVED CONFIRMATION OF WHEN
NANCY PELOSI WOULD VISIT THE

00:00:27.727 --> 00:00:29.162
VERY LAST MINUTE.
THEY DIDN'T HAVE ANY INPUT

00:00:29.162 --> 00:00:32.232
ABOUT THE TIMING OF THE TRIP.
IT WAS POSTPONED AFTER SPEAKER

00:00:32.232 --> 00:00:34.400
PELOSI CAME DOWN WITH COVID
BACK IN APRIL.

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:37.103
THE TIMING WAS CRUCIAL, BECAUSE
IT CAME JUST MONTHS BEFORE A

00:00:37.103 --> 00:00:39.105
SENSITIVE POLITICAL GATHERING
IN BEIJING.

00:00:39.105 --> 00:00:42.175
CHINA IS BLAMING THE TIMING OF
THE VISIT ON THE MILITARY

00:00:42.175 --> 00:00:44.077
DRILLS THAT HAVE BEEN ONGOING
EVER SINCE.

00:00:44.077 --> 00:00:46.513
BUT I WANT FOREIGN MINISTER
SAYS, HE DOESN'T.

00:00:46.513 --> 00:00:49.749
BY HE SAYS IS JUST PART OF A
CHINESE CAMPAIGN TO INTIMIDATE

00:00:49.749 --> 00:00:51.150
TAIWAN AND ISOLATE THEM ON A
GLOBAL STAGE.

00:00:51.150 --> 00:00:56.789
&gt;&gt; AS TAIWAN WAS LIGHTING UP A
LANDMARK FOR U.S. HOUSE SPEAKER,

00:00:56.789 --> 00:00:59.192
NANCY PELOSI, CHINA WAS
LIGHTING UP THE SKIES.

00:00:59.192 --> 00:01:01.628
AND SEAS, A ROUND THE SELF
GOVERNING DEMOCRACY.

00:01:01.628 --> 00:01:06.099
A DEMOCRACY IN DANGER OF A
CHINESE TAKEOVER, IF BEIJING'S

00:01:06.099 --> 00:01:11.037
COMMUNIST RULERS GET THEIR WAY.
PELOSI WAS IN TAIWAN LESS THAN

00:01:11.037 --> 00:01:15.175
24 HOURS.
LEAVING BEHIND A CRISIS SOME

00:01:15.175 --> 00:01:18.244
SAY SHE HELPED CREATE.
&gt;&gt; WAS THERE ANY CONCERN IN

00:01:18.244 --> 00:01:20.647
TAIPEI ABOUT THE TIMING OF THIS
AND WHETHER IT MIGHT PROVOKE

00:01:20.647 --> 00:01:21.848
SOME SORT OF REACTION FROM
CHINA?

00:01:21.848 --> 00:01:26.786
&gt;&gt; WE KNEW THE CHINA ALWAYS
REACTED BADLY WHENEVER WE HAD

00:01:26.786 --> 00:01:28.021
GOOD FRIENDS COMING TO VISIT
US.

00:01:28.021 --> 00:01:32.525
THE CHINESE GOVERNMENT CANNOT
DICTATE WHO CAN COME AND WHO

00:01:32.525 --> 00:01:36.596
CANNOT COME.
AND THEY CANNOT DICTATE TAIWAN,

00:01:36.596 --> 00:01:39.299
WHO CAN BE OUR FRIENDS OR WHO
WE SHOULD MAKE FRIENDS WITH.

00:01:39.299 --> 00:01:41.668
&gt;&gt; FORWARD IF CHINA GOES
FURTHER AS A RESULT OF THESE

00:01:41.668 --> 00:01:43.303
VISITS?
OR USING THIS VISIT AS AN

00:01:43.303 --> 00:01:45.071
EXCUSE?
DO THE BENEFITS OUTWEIGH THE

00:01:45.071 --> 00:01:48.441
RISK FOR TAIWAN?
&gt;&gt; ONE, IS WHAT CHINA IS DOING

00:01:48.441 --> 00:01:55.081
IS UNWARRANTED.
AND WHAT IT IS DOING IS

00:01:55.081 --> 00:01:56.516
UPSETTING THE PEACE AND
STABILITY IN THE WESTERN

00:01:56.516 --> 00:01:57.784
PACIFIC.
AND IT IS SOMETHING THAT SHOULD

00:01:57.784 --> 00:01:59.953
NOT BE WELCOMED BY
INTERNATIONAL COMMUNITY.

00:01:59.953 --> 00:02:03.156
&gt;&gt; TAIWAN'S FOREIGN MINISTER,
JOSEPH WU, TELL CNN CHINA'S

00:02:03.156 --> 00:02:05.225
WERE GAMES ARE FORMED ISOLATING
THE ISLAND.

00:02:05.225 --> 00:02:09.128
PELOSI, THE MOST POWERFUL
POLITICIAN TO VISIT IN 25

00:02:09.128 --> 00:02:11.864
YEARS.
&gt;&gt; IS TAIWAN A MORE DANGER

00:02:11.864 --> 00:02:13.366
TODAY THAN IT WAS BEFORE NANCY
PELOSI'S VISIT?

00:02:13.366 --> 00:02:16.102
&gt;&gt; CHINA HAS ALWAYS BEEN
THREATENING TAIWAN.

00:02:16.102 --> 00:02:20.340
FOR YEARS.
AND IT IS GETTING MORE SERIOUS

00:02:20.340 --> 00:02:22.575
IN THE LAST FEW YEARS.
AND IT'S ALWAYS BEEN THAT WAY.

00:02:22.575 --> 00:02:29.582
WHETHER SPEAKER PELOSI VISITS
TAIWAN OR NOT, THE CHINESE

00:02:29.582 --> 00:02:31.451
MILITARY THREAT AGAINST TAIWAN
HAS ALREADY BEEN THERE.

00:02:31.451 --> 00:02:33.953
&gt;&gt; WOULD YOU BELIEVE CHINA'S
MOTIVATION IS?

00:02:33.953 --> 00:02:35.688
AND DO YOU THINK THEIR TIMELINE
HAS CHANGED?

00:02:35.688 --> 00:02:39.659
&gt;&gt; CHINA'S MOTIVATION, AS I
SAID A LITTLE BIT EARLIER, IS

00:02:39.659 --> 00:02:42.662
NOT GOING TO END AT TAIWAN.
THEY CLAIM THE EAST CHINA SEA,

00:02:42.662 --> 00:02:45.965
THEY CLAIM SOUTH CHINA SEA.
THEY WORK VERY HARD TO GO TO

00:02:45.965 --> 00:02:49.736
THE PACIFIC.
THEIR INFLUENCE IN SOUTH ASIA

00:02:49.736 --> 00:02:53.473
AND AFRICA, EVEN IN LATIN
AMERICA, IS UNPRECEDENTED THESE

00:02:53.473 --> 00:02:56.142
DAYS.
AND THEREFORE, IT HAS A GLOBAL

00:02:56.142 --> 00:02:59.679
AMBITION.
&gt;&gt; AMBITION DRIVEN BY CHINA'S

00:02:59.679 --> 00:03:03.583
MOST POWERFUL LEADER SINCE MAO.
XI JINPING, ON TRACK TO BECOME

00:03:03.583 --> 00:03:06.085
PRESIDENT FOR LIFE.
WITH A BURNING DESIRE TO UNIFY

00:03:06.085 --> 00:03:08.121
WITH TAIWAN, BY FORCE IF
NECESSARY.

00:03:08.121 --> 00:03:11.791
&gt;&gt; HAS TAIWAN'S DEMOCRATIC
SYSTEM EVER BEEN IN MORE DANGER

00:03:11.791 --> 00:03:15.695
THAN IT IS TODAY?
&gt;&gt; I CAN TELL YOU THE TAIWAN IS

00:03:15.695 --> 00:03:18.064
MORE RESILIENT THAN BEFORE.
LOOK AT TAIWAN THESE DAYS.

00:03:18.064 --> 00:03:23.036
CHINA IS TRYING TO IMPOSE TRADE
SANCTIONS AGAINST TAIWAN,

00:03:23.036 --> 00:03:25.438
TRYING TO ATTACK TAIWAN FROM
MILITARY OR NON MILITARY

00:03:25.438 --> 00:03:28.408
ASPECTS.
BUT LIFE GOES ON HERE IN

00:03:28.408 --> 00:03:30.710
TAIWAN.
&gt;&gt; SHOULD PEOPLE IN BE MORE

00:03:30.710 --> 00:03:32.612
WORRIED?
&gt;&gt; IF YOU ASK ME, I WORRY.

00:03:32.612 --> 00:03:35.114
A LITTLE BIT.
&gt;&gt; WHAT DO YOU WORRY ABOUT?

00:03:35.114 --> 00:03:38.017
&gt;&gt; I WORRY CHINA MAY REALLY
LAUNCH A WAR AGAINST TAIWAN.

00:03:38.017 --> 00:03:41.554
BUT WHAT IT'S DOING RIGHT NOW,
IS TRYING TO SCARE US.

00:03:41.554 --> 00:03:45.792
AND THE BEST WAY TO DEAL WITH,
IT TO SHOW TO CHINA, THAT WE

00:03:45.792 --> 00:03:49.529
ARE NOT SCARED.
&gt;&gt; CHINA IS DEFENDING ITS

00:03:49.529 --> 00:03:56.302
ACTIONS AS, LEGITIMATE,
JUSTIFIED, BECAUSE THEY CLAIM

00:03:56.302 --> 00:03:59.205
THE TAIWAN IS A PART OF CHINA.
EVEN THOUGH THE COMMUNIST

00:03:59.205 --> 00:04:07.880
RULERS IN BEIJING HAVE NEVER
WON OVER THE LAST 70 PLUS YEARS

00:04:07.880 --> 00:04:12.118
--
CHINA SAYS THE VISIT OF NANCY

00:04:12.118 --> 00:04:14.420
PELOSI --
IT COULD UNDERMANNED THE PEACE

00:04:14.420 --> 00:04:17.190
AND STABILITY OF THE TAIWAN.
STRAIGHT BUT HERE IN TAIWAN,

00:04:17.190 --> 00:04:20.326
THEY SAY CHINA UNDERMINING --
AND THEY NEED TO BRING IN

00:04:20.326 --> 00:04:22.295
FRIENDS FROM AROUND THE WORLD
TO SEE THE SITUATION HERE.

00:04:22.295 --> 00:04:26.366
AND HELP TAIWAN IF THE TIME
COMES.

00:04:26.366 --> 00:04:28.234
WILL RIPLEY, CNN, TAIPEI.

